repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115143","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115143.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115143.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-29T00:03:46Z"},"body":"- Tweak loading page for better usability and match the Godot editor style guide (e.g. buttons use Title Case text).\r\n- Update theming to match the default theme as of Godot 4.6.\r\n- Use [Inter font with OpenType features](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111140) to match the Godot 4.6 default.\r\n- Use `:focus-visible` in CSS to hide focus outlines on mouse/touch input (matches Godot 4.6+ behavior).\r\n- Remove video driver selection, as only WebGL 2 is available.\r\n- Fix Open Graph image being 404 by using the same image as the website's homepage.\r\n- Tweak welcome dialog text and add a link to the editor download page.\r\n- Hide \"(Try this for example)\" link once a file is selected.\r\n- Fix Open Graph image being 404.\r\n  - Note that this will need to be updated once https://github.com/godotengine/godot-website/pull/1229 is merged.\r\n- Link to the `stable` branch of the documentation instead of `latest`, since it lacks the version warning at the top.\r\n\r\nTested on Chromium 143, Firefox 146 and Safari on macOS 26.1.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### Loader tab\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1411\" height=\"832\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb807498-90e2-4a00-8019-6ed5409456fd\" /> | <img width=\"1411\" height=\"832\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-19 at 20-29-34 Godot Engine Web Editor (4 6 rc custom_build)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2902b871-73c8-46cc-a6f8-91da6acce0bb\" />\r\n\r\n### Project manager\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1411\" height=\"835\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37af4ce6-7aaa-4b20-a959-3ab0b6052a5d\" /> | <img width=\"1411\" height=\"834\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/987bf5cf-f92e-4b2e-aa8b-f39fa4a2b36c\" />\r\n\r\n### New welcome dialog\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1422\" height=\"824\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0d9751f-82e1-43ea-89c5-3cc9623221a8\" />\r\n\r\n## TODO (in future PRs)\r\n\r\n- Add ZIP download links for each demo to [godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects](https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/) (using one of the tools mentioned [here](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/7106012/download-a-single-folder-or-directory-from-a-github-repository)), and replace the existing demo link with a link to that page instead.\r\n  - This will allow users to quickly run and edit any official demo that is web-friendly.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115143/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115143/timeline","performed_via_g